how does the device know which part of the IP belongs to network and which part to the host
it uses subnet mask

subnet mask:
    it a number consists of 32 bit just like the IP address
    and comes always with the IP address

    you cant have an IP withtout a subnet mask

    255.255.255.0

    255 == this part of the ip address belongs to the network
    0 == belong to the device Address



